                            "CB_PERF_SEL_FC_CACHE_ACK_OUTPUT_STALL: Number of cycles the fmask cache is stalled because the acknowledge output path is stalled. This can happen if the next stage in the pipeline (fmask cache read latency hiding fifo) is full and stalling the fmask cache so the cache cannot output any transactions. " = 0x59, 
                            "CB_PERF_SEL_FC_CACHE_STALL: Number of cycles the fmask cache is stalled. This is the combined cache stall signal. " = 0x5a, 
