                            "CB_PERF_SEL_CC_DCC_KEY_VALUE__1BLOCK_4TO2__1BLOCK_4TO4: From DCC Compressor in Color Cache:  Number of times sector 1 was compressed as 4:2 blocks and sector 0 was compressed as 4:4 (uncompressed). " = 0x121, 
                            "CB_PERF_SEL_CC_DCC_KEY_VALUE__1BLOCK_4TO3__1BLOCK_4TO1: From DCC Compressor in Color Cache:  Number of times sector 1 was compressed as 4:3 blocks and sector 0 was compressed as 4:1 blocks. " = 0x122, 
