                            "CB_PERF_SEL_CC_DCC_KEY_VALUE__1BLOCK_4TO4__1BLOCK_4TO1: From DCC Compressor in Color Cache:  Number of times sector 1 was compressed as 4:4 (uncompressed) and sector 0 was compressed as 4:1 blocks. " = 0x126, 
                            "CB_PERF_SEL_CC_DCC_KEY_VALUE__1BLOCK_4TO4__1BLOCK_4TO2: From DCC Compressor in Color Cache:  Number of times sector 1 was compressed as 4:4 (uncompressed) and sector 0 was compressed as 4:2 blocks. " = 0x127, 
                            "CB_PERF_SEL_CC_DCC_KEY_VALUE__1BLOCK_4TO4__1BLOCK_4TO3: From DCC Compressor in Color Cache:  Number of times sector 1 was compressed as 4:4 (uncompressed) and sector 0 was compressed as 4:3 blocks. " = 0x128, 
                            "CB_PERF_SEL_CC_DCC_KEY_VALUE__2BLOCKS_2TO1__1BLOCK_4TO1: From DCC Compressor in Color Cache:  Number of times sectors 1 and 2 were compressed as 2:1 blocks and sector 0 was compressed as 4:1 blocks. " = 0x129, 
                            "CB_PERF_SEL_CC_DCC_KEY_VALUE__2BLOCKS_2TO1__1BLOCK_4TO2: From DCC Compressor in Color Cache:  Number of times sectors 1 and 2 were compressed as 2:1 blocks and sector 0 was compressed as 4:2 blocks. " = 0x12a, 
