                            "CB_PERF_SEL_CC_DCC_KEY_VALUE__2BLOCKS_2TO1__1BLOCK_4TO4: From DCC Compressor in Color Cache:  Number of times sectors 1 and 2 were compressed as 2:1 blocks and sector 0 was compressed as 4:4 (uncompressed). " = 0x12c, 
                            "CB_PERF_SEL_CC_DCC_KEY_VALUE__1BLOCK_2TO1__1BLOCK_2TO2__1BLOCK_4TO1: From DCC Compressor in Color Cache:  Number of times sector 2 was compressed as 2:1 blocks, sector 1 was compressed as 2:2 (uncompressed) and sector 0 was compressed as 4:1 blocks. " = 0x12d, 
