    PERF_SEL3  19:10  ALPHA {"PERF_PAPC_PASX_REQ: PERF_PAPC_PASX_REQ                     Number of PA->SX requests; increment rate-one per clock (each req leads to 4 cycles of data from SX); range-1/clk, it does not indicate bad performance; it cannot be used to locate bottlenecks; all instances report the same result; can be combined with PASX_FIRST_VECTOR,PASX_SECOND_VECTOR, PASX_VTX_KILL_DISCARD, PASX_VTX_NAN_DISCARD, PASX_FIRST_DEAD, PASX_FIRST_DEAD  " = 0x0, 
