                            "SQC_PERF_SEL_DCACHE_CACHE_STALL_ALLOC_UNAVAILABLE: Number of cycles stalled due to not being able to allocate a line.  (per-Bank, nondeterministic, unwindowed) " = 0xe0, 
                            "SQC_PERF_SEL_DCACHE_CACHE_STALL_FORCE_EVICT: Number of cycles stalled due to having to force an eviction.  (per-Bank, nondeterministic, unwindowed) " = 0xe1, 
