                            "SQC_PERF_SEL_TC_STALL: Valid request stalled TC request interface (no-credits). (No-Masking, nondeterministic, unwindowed) " = 0xb3, 
                            "SQC_PERF_SEL_TC_STARVE: No requests sent to TC while credits available. (No-Masking, nondeterministic, unwindowed) " = 0xb4, 
                            "SQC_PERF_SEL_ICACHE_BUSY_CYCLES: Clock cycles while cache is reporting that it is busy.  (No-Masking, nondeterministic, unwindowed) " = 0xb5, 
