                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_LDS_UNALIGNED_STALL: Number of cycles LDS is stalled processing flat unaligned load/store ops. (emulated) " = 0x63, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_LDS_MEM_VIOLATIONS: Number of threads that have a memory violation in the LDS.(emulated) " = 0x64, 
