                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_INST_CYCLES_MISC: Number of cycles needed to execute BRANCH or SENDMSG instructions. (per-simd, emulated) " = 0x58, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_THREAD_CYCLES_VALU: Number of thread-cycles used to execute VALU operations (similar to INST_CYCLES_VALU but multiplied by # of active threads). (per-simd) " = 0x59, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_THREAD_CYCLES_VALU_MAX: Maximum number of thread-cycles VALU operations that could have been executed given the instruction mix (similar to INST_CYCLES_VALU but multiplied by # of active threads). (per-simd, emulated) " = 0x5a, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_IFETCH: Number of instruction fetch requests from cache. (per-simd, emulated) " = 0x5b, 
