                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_VALU_LDS_INTERP_OP: Number of LDS interpolation ops issued. (per-simd, emulated) " = 0x60, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_LDS_BANK_CONFLICT: Number of cycles LDS is stalled by bank conflicts. (emulated) " = 0x61, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_LDS_ADDR_CONFLICT: Number of cycles LDS is stalled by address conflicts. (emulated,nondeterministic) " = 0x62, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_LDS_UNALIGNED_STALL: Number of cycles LDS is stalled processing flat unaligned load/store ops. (emulated) " = 0x63, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_LDS_MEM_VIOLATIONS: Number of threads that have a memory violation in the LDS.(emulated) " = 0x64, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_LDS_ATOMIC_RETURN: Number of atomic return cycles in LDS. (per-simd, emulated) " = 0x65, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_LDS_IDX_ACTIVE: Number of cycles LDS is used for indexed (non-direct,non-interpolation) operations. (per-simd, emulated) " = 0x66, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_VALU_DEP_STALL: Number of cycles VALU is stalled by previous instructions due to dependencies (wait state count).  (nondeterministic) " = 0x67, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_VALU_STARVE: Number of cycles VALU is starved while waves are present. (per-simd, nondeterministic) " = 0x68, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_EXP_REQ_FIFO_FULL: Number of cycles export request fifo is full. (nondeterministic, unwindowed) " = 0x69, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_LDS_BACK2BACK_STALL: Number of cycles LDS command stalled due to back to back requests. (nondeterministic, unwindowed) " = 0x6a, 
