                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_VMEM_TA_CMD_FIFO_FULL: Number of cycles texture requests are stalled due to full cmd fifo in TA. (nondeterministic, unwindowed). " = 0x6f, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_VMEM_EX_DATA_REG_BUSY: Number of cycles texture requests are stalled due to full data staging register in EX. (nondeterministic, unwindowed). " = 0x70, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_VMEM_WR_BACK2BACK_STALL: Number of cycles texture writes are stalled due to back to back writes. (nondeterministic, unwindowed) " = 0x71, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_VMEM_WR_TA_DATA_FIFO_FULL: Number of cycles texture writes are stalled due to full data fifo in TA. (nondeterministic, unwindowed) " = 0x72, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_VALU_SRC_C_CONFLICT: Number of cycles VALU is stalled by arbitration due to src c conflict.  (nondeterministic, unwindowed) " = 0x73, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_VMEM_RD_SRC_CD_CONFLICT: Number of cycles VMEM_RD instructions are stalled due to VGPR port conflicts. (nondeterministic, unwindowed) " = 0x74, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_VMEM_WR_SRC_CD_CONFLICT: Number of cycles VMEM_WR instructions are stalled due to VGPR port conflicts. (nondeterministic, unwindowed) " = 0x75, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_FLAT_SRC_CD_CONFLICT: Number of cycles FLAT instructions are stalled due to VGPR port conflicts. (nondeterministic, unwindowed) " = 0x76, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_LDS_SRC_CD_CONFLICT: Number of cycles LDS instructions are stalled due to VGPR port conflicts. (nondeterministic, unwindowed) " = 0x77, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_SRC_CD_BUSY: Number of total accesses of port C and D (up to 2 per cycle). (per-simd) " = 0x78, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_PT_POWER_STALL: Number of cycles the power throttle indicated ALU should stall (ignores whether something actually got stalled).  (nondeterministic, unwindowed) " = 0x79, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_USER0: User counter.  Incremented by S_INCPERFLEVEL when SIMM16[3:0] == 0. (emulated) " = 0x7a, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_USER1: User counter.  Incremented by S_INCPERFLEVEL when SIMM16[3:0] == 1. (emulated) " = 0x7b, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_USER2: User counter.  Incremented by S_INCPERFLEVEL when SIMM16[3:0] == 2. (emulated) " = 0x7c, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_USER3: User counter.  Incremented by S_INCPERFLEVEL when SIMM16[3:0] == 3. (emulated) " = 0x7d, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_USER4: User counter.  Incremented by S_INCPERFLEVEL when SIMM16[3:0] == 4. (emulated) " = 0x7e, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_USER5: User counter.  Incremented by S_INCPERFLEVEL when SIMM16[3:0] == 5. (emulated) " = 0x7f, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_USER6: User counter.  Incremented by S_INCPERFLEVEL when SIMM16[3:0] == 6. (emulated) " = 0x80, 
