                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_INSTS_SMEM_NORM: Number of SMEM instructions issued normalized to match smem_level (*2 load/store; *2 atomic; *2 memtime; *4 wb/inv). (per-simd, emulated) " = 0x114, 
                            "SQ_PERF_SEL_ATC_INSTS_VMEM: Number of VMEM instructions issued to HSA space. (including FLAT) (per-simd, emulated) " = 0x115, 
