                            "PERFMON_COUNTER_MODE_STATISTICAL_MIN_LATENCY: Count the minimum latency of a start or end pair seen by the performance counter. PERF_SEL indicates the start and PERF_SEL_END indicates the end. These are considered statistical because it is only possible to track the latency of a single transaction at a time. Over time we hope to see the start end pair for a transaction that is closest to the shortest. When using this mode, program the counter result register MC_VM_PERFCOUNTER_LO to the maximum value before enabling counting. " = 0xf }  ;
    ENABLE  28:28  NUM ;
    CLEAR  29:29  NUM W;
};

